  "title": "Grounding",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "787ddae1-a213-494d-83fa-49e7b961bf2c",
      "text": "Grounding is a non-causal explanatory relation between facts, as when there is a party in virtue of people reveling. The grounded fact is nothing over and above its ground, unlike a causal product, which is a new being.",
